        "jsCode": "const DAYS_BETWEEN_FOLLOWUPS = 3;\nconst THRESHOLD_MS = DAYS_BETWEEN_FOLLOWUPS * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\nconst now = Date.now();\n\nconst eligible = items.filter(item => {\n  const lastSent = item.json.last_followup_sent_at;\n  if (!lastSent) return true;\n  const lastSentTime = new Date(lastSent).getTime();\n  return (now - lastSentTime) >= THRESHOLD_MS;\n});\n\nreturn eligible;"
